  "semantic_scope": "Fixed registered question wording, source integrity, wire identity, admission and response membership; no semantic proof of evidence sufficiency or repair correctness. D089 pins common worker dependency context, public docstring diagnostics and verified owner source context; no automatic ownership override or completion proof. D090 pins native app CLI and model-correct reference pricing; D089 task/repair policies unchanged. D091 adds lossless inline owner encoding and AST/verified artifact-family worker context. Version8 additionally validates guarded Jev Codex worker profile selection; version7 fixed workers. D092 jointly selects actually offered model and effort, with source-pinned public-only observed outcomes. No hidden feedback, learned calibration, automatic fallback, or completed-speed claim.",
